{
 "name": "tsavo_lion_looking_up",
 "description": "The finale lion: same pose and body as tsavo_lion_sitting (upright on its haunches facing right, long straight solid front legs, round haunch, tail wrapped forward along the ground with the dark tuft curled up in front of the front paws) but the head is tipped back about 45 degrees, gazing up (into a tree), patient, mouth closed flat. Must read as waiting, never roaring. Tsavo man-eater: lean maneless male, tawny #c9964a, pale chest, throat, muzzle and chin, rounded ears with dark backs, small amber eye with the pupil rolled up, heavy lid lifted (no highlight), thin throat fringe, two faint rib strokes. Silhouette-safe. Anchor bottom-centre, bbox x -200..222, y -500..0; nose about (+164,-488), eye about (+101,-444), tail tuft about (+208,-40).",
